Impact
The registration workflow proceeded after the OTP verification requests.
Email verification enforcement may be affected.
If the backend accepts an invalid OTP, users may be able to register without proving ownership of their email address.
Recommendation for Fix
Validate OTPs on the server before accepting verification.
Do not rely on client-side response handling for authentication decisions.
Maintain verification status on the server.
Bind OTPs to the correct email address and registration session.
Enforce OTP expiration and single-use restrictions.
Apply rate limits to OTP verification attempts.
